{
	"description": "Release-body changelog extraction vectors. Replayed by tools/test/test-release-body-sections.cjs through splitReleaseBody (_shared/ui/changelog/release_body.js) and by the Windows AHK suite through _Updater_ReleaseNotesChangelog (modules/updater/changelog.ahk), which ports that extraction for the native notes view. body and changelog are line arrays joined with a line feed. Cover every body format CI has published: section markers, the folded changelog after the downloads (de5ef9ebf), the changelog-first body with a jump link, and the oldest body without a Downloads heading.",
